{"about_the_game":"<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/af25064eb8fdfa548189601ab70957f1.poster.avif?t=1767781708\" width=678 height=256 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/af25064eb8fdfa548189601ab70957f1.webm?t=1767781708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/af25064eb8fdfa548189601ab70957f1.mp4?t=1767781708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Meet Solana!</h2>Equipped with her advanced NX-37 Combat Harness and trusty sidearm, Solana has ventured out on the border sectors to find her way as a salvage and rescue operator. During one of her regular runs to the debris fields of the abandoned Zetrian system, she picks up a distress signal and sets down on a frigid exoplanet to discover the source.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Help her!</h2>Zetria is a pixel/retro style platformer with action and puzzle elements. Help Solana jump, shoot and think her way through the perils and dangers ahead to rescue the missing facility workers!<br>There are nine levels in total, and a few secret areas to find and unlock too.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/e1f015b8070c423fd289cbcab4214f40.poster.avif?t=1767781708\" width=800 height=346 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/e1f015b8070c423fd289cbcab4214f40.webm?t=1767781708\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1960920/extras/e1f015b8070c423fd289cbcab4214f40.mp4?t=1767781708\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Enjoy the rewards!</h2>Zetria